---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="description" content="Lionceau Agre - Senior Expert in AI, Climate Tech, and Data Governance." />
    <meta name="keywords" content="AI governance, climate AI, data governance Africa, ISO 42001" />
    <meta name="author" content="Lionceau Agre" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Lionceau Agre | AI, Climate & Governance Expert" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="AI governance & climate-tech for Africa — ISO 42001 lead implementer." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://lionceauagre.ai" />

    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Lionceau Clovis AGRE",
      "jobTitle": "AI & Climate Governance Expert",
      "url": "https://lionceauagre.ai",
      "sameAs": [
        "https://www.linkedin.com/in/lionceau-clovis-agre-074a0b1b1/",
        "https://github.com/LionsClo",
        "https://x.com/AgreLionceau"
      ]
    }
    </script>

    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../styles/global.css" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <title>Lionceau Agre | AI, Climate & Governance Expert</title>
</head>

<body class="bg-[#0a0a0a] text-gray-300 font-['Inter'] antialiased selection:bg-cyan-500/30 overflow-x-hidden">

    <!-- SCROLL PROGRESS BAR -->
    <div id="scroll-progress" class="fixed top-0 left-0 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-blue-500 to-purple-500 z-[100] w-0 transition-none"></div>

    <!-- PARTICLE CANVAS BACKGROUND -->
    <canvas id="particle-canvas" class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40"></canvas>

    <!-- DECORATIVE BLOBS -->
    <div class="fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-[-15%] left-[-10%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-cyan-500/8 rounded-full blur-[150px] animate-pulse"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-[-15%] right-[-10%] w-[700px] h-[700px] bg-blue-600/8 rounded-full blur-[150px] animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 2s;"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-[40%] right-[20%] w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-purple-600/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 4s;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- TOAST CONTAINER -->
    <div id="toast-container" class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-[200] flex flex-col gap-3"></div>

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->
    <nav class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 border-b border-white/10 bg-[#0a0a0a]/70 backdrop-blur-xl">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex justify-between items-center">
            <a href="#" class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
                    <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-cyan-400 opacity-75"></span>
                    <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-cyan-400"></span>
                </span>
                Lionceauagre<span class="text-cyan-400">.ai</span>
            </a>
            
            <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-7 text-[13px] font-medium">
                <a href="#about" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="nav_about">About</a>
                <a href="#projects" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="nav_projects">Projects</a>
                <a href="#demos" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="nav_demos">Live Demos</a>
                <a href="#endorsements" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">Endorsements</a>
                <a href="#media" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors" data-i18n="nav_media">Media</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="bg-white text-black px-5 py-2 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-cyan-400 transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.3)]" data-i18n="nav_hire">Hire Me</a>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <button id="lang-toggle" class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-cyan-400 border border-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md transition-colors" title="Toggle language">FR</button>
                <button id="menu-btn" class="lg:hidden text-white focus:outline-none p-2" aria-label="Toggle menu">
                    <svg id="menu-icon-open" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path></svg>
                    <svg id="menu-icon-close" class="w-5 h-5 hidden" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden lg:hidden bg-[#0a0a0a]/95 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-white/10 absolute w-full">
            <div class="flex flex-col p-6 space-y-1">
                <a href="#about" class="mobile-link py-3 px-4 rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:text-cyan-400 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">About</a>
                <a href="#projects" class="mobile-link py-3 px-4 rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:text-cyan-400 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Projects</a>
                <a href="#demos" class="mobile-link py-3 px-4 rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:text-cyan-400 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Live Demos</a>
                <a href="#endorsements" class="mobile-link py-3 px-4 rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:text-cyan-400 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Endorsements</a>
                <a href="#media" class="mobile-link py-3 px-4 rounded-lg text-gray-300 hover:text-cyan-400 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all">Media</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="mt-4 bg-cyan-500 text-black px-4 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold text-center">Hire Me</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="relative z-10 pt-16">

        <!-- HERO SECTION -->
        <section class="min-h-[92vh] flex items-center px-6">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center w-full">
                <div class="space-y-7">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/30 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 text-[11px] font-mono tracking-widest uppercase">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                        <span data-i18n="hero_tag">AI Governance &middot; Climate Tech &middot; Data Sovereignty</span>
                    </div>
                    
                    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[4.2rem] font-black text-white leading-[1.08] tracking-tight">
                        Architecting <br />
                        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-blue-500 to-purple-500">Responsible AI</span> <br />
                        <span data-i18n="hero_subtitle">for emerging economies.</span>
                    </h1>

                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-lg leading-relaxed" data-i18n="hero_desc">
                        I bridge the gap between advanced machine learning, climate action, and public policy with ISO 42001 compliance. Production-ready ML for low-resource public systems.
                    </p>

                    <!-- TRUST BADGES (LOGOS REDUITS) -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1">
                        <a href="#" class="group flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/50 hover:bg-cyan-500/5 transition-all cursor-pointer" title="ISO 42001 Lead Implementer Certificate">
                            <span class="text-cyan-400 text-xs">🛡️</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-gray-400 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">ISO 42001</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="#" class="group flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:bg-purple-500/5 transition-all cursor-pointer" title="CIPP/E Privacy Certificate">
                            <span class="text-purple-400 text-xs">🔒</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-gray-400 group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">CIPP/E</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="#" class="group flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:border-amber-500/50 hover:bg-amber-500/5 transition-all cursor-pointer" title="CAIDP Certification">
                            <span class="text-amber-400 text-xs">📜</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-gray-400 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">CAIDP</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-3">
                        <a href="#demos" class="group px-7 py-3.5 bg-cyan-500 text-black font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-cyan-400 transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.25)] hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(6,182,212,0.4)] transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-sm">
                            <span data-i18n="hero_cta1">View Live Demos</span>
                            <span class="inline-block ml-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&rarr;</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="/application-pack-lionceauagre.pdf" class="px-7 py-3.5 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-white/10 transition-all flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
                            <span data-i18n="hero_cta2">Application Pack</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="relative hidden lg:flex justify-center items-center">
                    <div class="relative w-80 h-80 xl:w-[380px] xl:h-[380px]">
                        <div id="hero-blob" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-500 to-purple-600 rounded-[2.5rem] rotate-6 opacity-25 blur-xl transition-transform duration-500 ease-out"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-cyan-500/20 animate-pulse" style="animation-duration: 3s;"></div>
                        <img src="/profile.jpeg" alt="Lionceau Agre - AI Governance Expert" class="relative w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 shadow-2xl" loading="eager">
                        
                        <div class="absolute -bottom-5 -left-5 bg-[#111]/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 p-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-3 hover:scale-105 transition-transform cursor-default">
                            <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-green-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 font-bold text-sm">40+</div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Open Source</p>
                                <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Production Repos</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="absolute -top-5 -right-5 bg-[#111]/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 p-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-3 hover:scale-105 transition-transform cursor-default">
                            <div class="w-11 h-11 bg-cyan-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 font-bold text-sm">5+</div>
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Countries</p>
                                <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Impact Deployed</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- LOGO MARQUEE -->
        <section class="border-y border-white/5 bg-white/[0.015] py-5 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 mb-3">
                <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-center" data-i18n="logos_label">Trusted by leading organizations</p>
            </div>
            <div class="relative">
                <div class="flex animate-marquee whitespace-nowrap">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-12 mx-6">
                        <a href="https://www.unicef.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">UNICEF</a>
                        <a href="https://caidp.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">CAIDP</a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">FRIARE</a>
                        <a href="https://www.unesco.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">UNESCO</a>
                        <a href="https://www.etsi.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">ETSI</a>
                        <a href="https://aniti.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">ANITI</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-12 mx-6">
                        <a href="https://www.unicef.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">UNICEF</a>
                        <a href="https://caidp.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">CAIDP</a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">FRIARE</a>
                        <a href="https://www.unesco.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">UNESCO</a>
                        <a href="https://www.etsi.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">ETSI</a>
                        <a href="https://aniti.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500/50 hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors tracking-widest">ANITI</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0a0a0a] to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
                <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-24 bg-gradient-to-l from-[#0a0a0a] to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- METRICS COUNTERS -->
        <section class="py-16 px-6 border-b border-white/5">
            <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <div class="text-center p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white counter" data-target="6" data-suffix="+">0</p>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-2 uppercase tracking-wider" data-i18n="metric_projects">Projects Deployed</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white counter" data-target="1200" data-suffix="+">0</p>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-2 uppercase tracking-wider" data-i18n="metric_lives">Lives Reached via Talks</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white counter" data-target="85000" data-suffix="" data-format="kWh">0</p>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-2 uppercase tracking-wider" data-i18n="metric_kwh">kWh/yr Forecast Capacity</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all group">
                    <p class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white counter" data-target="50" data-suffix="+">0</p>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-2 uppercase tracking-wider" data-i18n="metric_mentored">People Trained/Mentored</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
        <section id="about" class="py-24 px-6">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16">
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6 reveal-up">
                    <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest" data-i18n="about_label">Who I Am</p>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white" data-i18n="about_title">About Me</h2>
                    <div class="h-1 w-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-[17px] text-gray-400 reveal-up" style="transition-delay: 0.15s;">
                    <p class="leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_p1">
                        <!-- CHANGE SENIOR TO ML ENGINEER -->
                        ML Engineer & AI Governance Specialist. I design AI architectures for energy transition, strictly aligned with <strong class="text-white">ISO 42001</strong> & <strong class="text-white">CIPP/E</strong> frameworks.
                    </p>
                    <p class="leading-relaxed" data-i18n="about_p2">
                        I advise governments on data sovereignty. My approach is "frugal": delivering industrial-grade ML tailored for low-resource contexts. I don't just write code; I build ecosystems for sustainable digital infrastructure.
                    </p>
                    
                    <!-- Trust Lines -->
                    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4">
                        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" data-i18n="trust_role_label">Current Role</p>
                            <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm" data-i18n="trust_role">AI Governance Advisor</p>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-0.5" data-i18n="trust_role_org">CAIDP Africa</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" data-i18n="trust_fellow_label">Top Fellowship</p>
                            <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm" data-i18n="trust_fellow">ANITI Fellow</p>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-0.5" data-i18n="trust_fellow_year">2023 — Present</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5">
                            <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" data-i18n="trust_talk_label">Keynote</p>
                            <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm" data-i18n="trust_talk">TEDx Cotonou</p>
                            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-0.5" data-i18n="trust_talk_year">"Frugal AI" — 2024</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ENDORSEMENTS (NEW GRID WITH 8 QUOTES) -->
        <section id="endorsements" class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#0c0c0c] border-y border-white/5">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
                <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal-up">
                    <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest" data-i18n="endorse_label">What Leaders Say</p>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mt-2">Endorsements</h2>
                </div>
                
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <!-- 1. Benjamin Gomado -->
                    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#111] border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all reveal-up">
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-4">"Lionceau led solar-track initiatives with rare technical rigor and field sensibility; his forecasts and system designs directly improved pilot reliability — I recommend him without reservation for any senior role in climate‑tech or energy systems."</p>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Benjamin Gomado</p>
                            <p class="text-cyan-400 text-xs mt-1">Program Facilitator, AFYEL Fellowship</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 2. Vinasetan Ratheil Houndji -->
                    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#111] border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all reveal-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-4">"As his academic supervisor, I witnessed Lionceau combine deep theoretical insight with applied impact — his research in AI governance is scholarly, policy‑ready and indispensable for projects bridging academia and government."</p>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Vinasetan Ratheil Houndji</p>
                            <p class="text-purple-400 text-xs mt-1">Lecturer & Researcher in AI, Univ. of Abomey‑Calavi; President, FRIARE Foundation</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 3. David -->
                    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#111] border border-white/10 hover:border-green-500/30 transition-all reveal-up" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-4">"Lionceau contributed invaluable, practical insights during our pilots; his strategic perspective on trustworthy AI elevated our product thinking — he is a rare practitioner who turns ethical principles into operational solutions."</p>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">David</p>
                            <p class="text-green-400 text-xs mt-1">Founder, PrinciplesAI</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 4. Marjorie Allain-Moulet -->
                    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#111] border border-white/10 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all reveal-up" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-4">"Lionceau brings industrial engineering discipline and cross‑sector leadership to AI projects; his ability to translate complex models into robust, deployable systems makes him an exceptional collaborator and leader."</p>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Marjorie Allain‑Moulet, PhD</p>
                            <p class="text-amber-400 text-xs mt-1">Head R&D AI & Data, CS GROUP</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 5. Stephanie Grasser -->
                    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#111] border border-white/10 hover:border-pink-500/30 transition-all reveal-up" style="transition-delay: 0.4s;">
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm italic leading-relaxed mb-4">"Working alongside Lionceau at CAIDP, I saw his uncompromising commitment to rights‑based AI governance — his analyses are rigorous, actionable, and urgently needed by policymakers."</p>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Stephanie Grasser</p>
                            <p class="text-pink-400 text-xs mt-1">Project Manager, JUKUS; Human Rights Advocate</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

